      "title": "Senior Vice President for Finance & Administration / Chief Financial Officer",
      "description": "The University of Tulsa is pleased to announce a national search for Senior Vice President for Finance and Administration (VPFA) to serve as the institution’s Chief Financial Officer. This is an exceptional opportunity for a strategic and technology-forward financial leader to play a major role in shaping the future of The University of Tulsa as it embarks on its next chapter. Serving as a partner and trusted advisor to incoming President Stacy Leeds, the successful candidate will be committed to innovation, operational excellence and transparency. The VPFA will steward and maximize financial resources in ways that strengthen academic excellence, enrich the student experience, and optimize research impact and industry partnerships. The VPFA will be an important institutional and broader community partner that significantly contributes to the shared successes and vitality of the University, the vibrant City of Tulsa, and other key partners and investors. ",
      "department": null
    },
